# Harness Decisions

## Decision 001: Project-local harness

Reason:
The harness is strongly tied to this repository's structure, risks, verification commands, and agent workflow.

Implication:
Do not modify user-global Codex/Claude configuration unless explicitly requested.

## Decision 002: Keep root AGENTS.md short

Reason:
Root instructions should route agents to the right context and checks, not become a stale knowledge base.
